# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*.tfvars.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# File tfvars lokal (boleh beda-beda per orang/mesin) - contoh tetap di-commit
# lewat *.tfvars.example
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
secrets.tfvars

# Kecuali: users.auto.tfvars di iam/ BUKAN rahasia/lokal - isinya cuma daftar
# nama user (readonly/admin), SENGAJA di-commit & di-review lewat PR (lihat
# README.md bagian "IAM user & akses").
!envs/*/iam/users.auto.tfvars

